      "statement": "scripts/os-pio-env.sh makes PIO 6.2.0 work under the nix store layout: it derives the nix store site dirs at runtime from the pio wrapper's site.addsitedir list, creates a penv venv with intelhex==2.3.0 pinned, exports PYTHONPATH for the SCons subprocess, and points PYTHONEXEPATH at a generated wrapper for esptool children — because PIO runs the build in a bare-interpreter subprocess that lacks the nix site dirs and the espidf framework strips PYTHONPATH.",
